<title>FRANCE: Rouen Jan 1-8 grain exports at 89,641 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen Jan 1-8 grain exports at 89,641 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain exports from Rouen were 89,641 tonnes between January 1 and January 8, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Grain exports totalled 418,000 tonnes in the whole of January 1996.</p>
<p>The 89,641 tonnes included 42,241 tonnes of wheat and 47,400 tonnes of barley which was for Saudi Arabia.</p>
<p>Officials gave the following breakdown by destination (in tonnes).</p>
<p>WHEAT</p>
<p>    West Africa		    6,500</p>
<p>    Cuba			    23,141</p>
<p>    Britain			  4,500</p>
<p>    Italy			    8,100</p>
<p>BARLEY</p>
<p>    Saudi Arabia		  47,400</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
